1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,085
Part twelve. Delivery challans.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,850
Open the project and tap Send material.

3
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:11,184
A delivery challan opens with the project and customer filled in.

4
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:17,318
Choose the warehouse it leaves from, the vehicle number and the transporter.

5
00:00:17,318 --> 00:00:22,340
Add the material: each line shows how much is in stock in that warehouse.

6
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:30,145
Set the status to Dispatched when the vehicle leaves and save.

7
00:00:30,145 --> 00:00:34,315
The material goes out of stock once, from that warehouse.

8
00:00:34,315 --> 00:00:38,265
If anything is short, the app tells you before saving.

9
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:43,602
Print the delivery challan to send with the vehicle.

10
00:00:43,602 --> 00:00:49,398
It has the consignee, vehicle, HSN, values and tax, in three copies.

11
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:53,244
Material left over after installation?

12
00:00:53,244 --> 00:00:56,742
Under Material at site, tap Return from site,

13
00:00:56,742 --> 00:01:00,396
type what came back and put it back into stock.

14
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:06,352
Next video: Purchase: vendors, orders and supplier payments.

